{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is approached, take it, check properties, if not visible - move, scan. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObjectProperties    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjects    />  <Action ID = CheckObjectWeight    /> <SubTree ID = DoSpecificTask    />\"",
